  "2026-07-29T04:54:34.898Z","harness:claude-code","Duplicate check before create: pm-cstl is CLOSED and made ONE threshold configurable, which is the per-constant remedy rather than the inventory; pm-tobi is CLOSED and set a destructive-default policy, a different axis; pm-z2j1qt is CLOSED and covered a single missing default bound on activity; pm-mfy1ux owns one command ignoring the row bound its siblings honour; pm-5t33or owns declared output budgets, which are one family within this population and whose values this item would label rather than choose; pm-m2il owns the scale conformance matrix that would let calibrated constants be re-fitted. Searched keyword and semantic for numeric constant, threshold, default, magic number, calibration; grepped the corpus for calibrat and magic number. No item owns the inventory or the labelling rule."
